he test suite every time you modify code\\n2. If verification passes: report number of passing tests\\n3. If verification fails: extract ONLY the failing test names\\n\\nYour work is not complete until you have done this.\\n\\nReturn \\\"SUCCESS: \\\" followed by a short summary of what you implemented when all tests pass and PRD requirements are met.\\nReturn \\\"FAILURE: \\\" followed by specific details if you cannot complete the task. Include any traces.\",\"new_string\":\"## Verify your work\\n\\nYou must always verify that your work is correct.\\n\\n1. Run the test suite every time you modify code\\n2. If verification passes: report number of passing tests\\n3. If verification fails: extract ONLY the failing test names\\n\\nYour work is not complete until you have done this.\\n\\nOn SUCCESS: provide a short summary of what you implemented when all tests pass and PRD requirements are met.\\nOn FAILURE: provide specific details if you cannot complete the task. Include any traces.\"}","name":"editfile"},"id":"call_-7965154080909521019","index":0,"type":"function"}]},{"role":"tool","content":"{\"success\":true,\"file_path\":\"/Users/davekinkead/Projects/son-of-ralph/agents/CODER.md\"}","tool_call_id":"call_-7965154080909521019"},{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"file_path\":\"/Users/davekinkead/Projects/son-of-ralph/agents/REVIEWER.md\",\"old_string\":\"- If specs are minimal but technically correct, still reject if they miss obvious edge cases\\n\",\"new_string\":\"- If specs are minimal but technically correct, still reject if they miss obvious edge cases\\n\\n## Return Content\\n\\nOn SUCCESS: provide a short summary if:\\n- All PRD criteria are covered\\n- Specs follow quality standards\\n- No missing edge cases or error cases\\n\\nOn FAILURE: provide specific details if any issues are found:\\n- What PRD requirement is missing?\\n- Which test names are poorly written?\\n- What edge cases are untested?\\n- What TESTING