eria are covered, specs follow quality standards, and no missing edge cases or error cases.\n\nOn FAILURE: provide specific details if any issues are found:\n- What PRD requirement is missing?\n- Which test names are poorly written?\n- What edge cases are untested?\n- What TESTING.md standard is violated?", file_path: "/Users/davekinkead/Projects/son-of-ralph/agents/REVIEWER.md", success: true}
