 CODER, REVIEWER, RALPH, HAIKU\\nFAILURE: Git not initialized. Cannot commit changes\\n```\\n\\n### When to Return COMPLETE\\n- All PRDs have been processed (completed or failed status)\\n- No PRDs found in prds/ directory (but directory exists)\\n- All PRDs already completed or failed when starting\\n\\n### When to Return FAILURE\\n- prds/ directory doesn't exist\\n- Agent spawn fails (first iteration)\\n- Git commit fails (blocking operation)\\n- File operation fails (blocking operation)\\n\\nReturn format uses standard SUCCESS/FAILURE prefixes: \\\"SUCCESS: message\\\" or \\\"FAILURE: message\\\"\",\"new_string\":\"## Return Content\\n\\nOn SUCCESS: provide a summary including:\\n- Number of PRDs completed\\n- Number of PRDs failed\\n- Git commit hashes (if any)\\n\\nOn FAILURE: provide specific details for:\\n- No PRDs directory found\\n- Invalid agent name\\n- Agent initialization failures\\n- Git operation failures\\n- File operation failures\"}","name":"editfile"},"id":"call_-7965175452667606224","index":0,"type":"function"}]},{"role":"tool","content":"{\"success\":true,\"file_path\":\"/Users/davekinkead/Projects/son-of-ralph/agents/RALPH.md\"}","tool_call_id":"call_-7965175452667606224"},{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"command\":\"bundle exec rspec spec/ralph/agent_spec.rb\"}","name":"bash"},"id":"call_-7965110100443035778","index":0,"type":"function"}]},{"role":"tool","content":"{\"output\":\"/Users/davekinkead/Projects/son-of-ralph/lib/ralph/logger.rb:2: warning: logger was loaded from the standard library, but will no longer be part of the default gems starting from Ruby 3.5.0.\\nYou can add logger to your Gemfile or gemspec to silence this warning.\\n/Users/davekinkead/Projects/son-of-ralph/lib/ralph/tool.rb:6: warning: method redefined; discarding old description\\n\\nRandomized with seed 51568\\n\\nRalph::Agent\\n #max_iterations\\n uses custom max_iterations from agent frontmatter\\n uses default max_iterati